{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scvi_n200 RNA encoder in a multiprofile setup, achieving higher validation accuracy (0.650) and F1 (0.627) compared to the pca_n2000-based multiprofile model (experiment 002). The result suggests the RNA encoder choice may contribute to performance improvements, though the role of avgpool aggregation and other factors remain untested. Generalization to multimodal settings or alternative encoders is uncertain."
}

